<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"><meta name="color-scheme" content="light"><title>Plush Massenger</title></head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#f1f5f9;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#172033;">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background-color:#f1f5f9;"><tr><td align="center" style="padding:32px 12px;">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="max-width:560px;background-color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:20px;">
<tr><td style="padding:28px;background-color:#172033;border-radius:20px 20px 0 0;">
<p style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:24px;line-height:32px;font-weight:700;color:#ffffff;"><%= appName %><span style="color:#a3e635;">.</span></p>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:11px;line-height:20px;letter-spacing:2px;color:#cbd5e1;">CONNECT. CHAT. STAY CLOSE.</p></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:32px 24px;"><h1 style="margin:0 0 20px;font-size:28px;line-height:36px;color:#172033;">A fresh start for your password.</h1><p style="margin:0 0 10px;font-size:15px;line-height:25px;color:#475569;">Hello <strong style="color:#172033;"><%= userName || 'there' %></strong>,</p><p style="margin:0 0 20px;font-size:15px;line-height:25px;color:#475569;">We received a request to reset your Plush Massenger password. Use the button below to choose a new one.</p><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:24px 0;"><tr><td style="background-color:#a3e635;border-radius:10px;"><a href="<%= resetUrl %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="display:inline-block;padding:16px 24px;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:#172033;text-decoration:none;">Reset password</a></td></tr></table><p style="margin:0 0 20px;font-size:15px;line-height:25px;color:#475569;">If you did not request this email, you can safely ignore it.</p><p style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:12px;line-height:20px;color:#64748b;">Button not working? Copy this link into your browser:</p><p style="margin:0;font-size:12px;line-height:20px;word-break:break-all;overflow-wrap:anywhere;color:#475569;"><%= resetUrl %></p></td></tr><tr><td align="center" style="padding:20px 24px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;">
<p style="margin:0 0 4px;font-size:12px;line-height:20px;color:#64748b;">Sent by <strong><%= appName %></strong></p>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:11px;line-height:18px;color:#94a3b8;">&copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> <%= appName %>. All rights reserved.</p>
</td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>
